1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,627
Lieutenant Kim Junho watched the screens in the combat information center.

2
00:00:06,627 --> 00:00:12,847
A Korean Navy liaison officer, his job was to send Seoul what he saw and heard.

3
00:00:12,847 --> 00:00:17,178
Larijani's name appeared on the list of confirmed dead.

4
00:00:17,178 --> 00:00:23,162
“I hear Trump went after Korea too?” asked U.S. Navy officer Mark Henderson.

5
00:00:23,162 --> 00:00:26,105
“No official reaction from our side.”

6
00:00:26,105 --> 00:00:28,492
Henderson gave a bitter laugh.

7
00:00:28,492 --> 00:00:29,923
“That's diplomacy.

8
00:00:29,923 --> 00:00:34,537
Saying nothing is still saying something.” Kim didn't nod.

9
00:00:34,537 --> 00:00:40,661
On a carrier before dawn, he wasn't sure saying nothing was really all right.

10
00:00:40,661 --> 00:00:42,729
Watching was a choice too.

11
00:00:42,729 --> 00:00:46,070
And every choice came with responsibility.

